{"id":"ac167a6d94ee8495","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded.md","title":"thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded","display":"thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded","aliases":["56-thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded"],"display":"thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded","depends_on":["[[56-df-simplification-order]]","[[56-df-well-founded]]","[[56-df-embedding-rules]]","[[56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding]]"],"source_section":"6.3.15(ii)","source_pages":"204","source_ocr_blocks":[225],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared; Kruskal-used-as-cited-theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-signature-simplification-order-well-founded"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2a80488e51ffa03\" href=\"?note=b2a80488e51ffa03\" title=\"56-df-simplification-order\">56-df-simplification-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3333ce5067a93fe7\" href=\"?note=3333ce5067a93fe7\" title=\"56-df-embedding-rules\">56-df-embedding-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5683a9cab2c7d87a\" href=\"?note=5683a9cab2c7d87a\" title=\"56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding\">56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.3.15(ii)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"204"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>225</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared; Kruskal-used-as-cited-theorem"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>工作于 ZFC。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|F|&lt;\\aleph_0\">\\(|F|&lt;\\aleph_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2a80488e51ffa03\" href=\"?note=b2a80488e51ffa03\" title=\"56-df-simplification-order\">56-df-simplification-order</a>。变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 可数无限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{RedOrd}\\)</span> 取该定义及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a> 的接口；证明所需的有限变量片段嵌入结论为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5683a9cab2c7d87a\" href=\"?note=5683a9cab2c7d87a\" title=\"56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding\">56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(T,Q)\\land\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(T,Q)\\land\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Proposition 6.3.15(ii)。假设无限下降序列，替换稳定和子项性质先排除下降中新出现的变量；因此该序列只用有限多个变量，将这些变量视作额外常元后签名仍有限。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5683a9cab2c7d87a\" href=\"?note=5683a9cab2c7d87a\" title=\"56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding\">56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding</a> 中已内建的 Kruskal 嵌入结论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;j\">\\(i&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_j\\to_{\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)}^*t_i\">\\(t_j\\to_{\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)}^*t_i\\)</span>，即较早项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\">\\(t_i\\)</span> 嵌入较晚项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_j\">\\(t_j\\)</span>；嵌入规则见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3333ce5067a93fe7\" href=\"?note=3333ce5067a93fe7\" title=\"56-df-embedding-rules\">56-df-embedding-rules</a>。子项性质和上下文封闭性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_j=t_i\">\\(t_j=t_i\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_j\\,Q\\,t_i\">\\(t_j\\,Q\\,t_i\\)</span>，而原下降给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\,Q\\,t_j\">\\(t_i\\,Q\\,t_j\\)</span>，与严格序的不可反性、传递性矛盾。输入文件记录了 p.204 的历史证明核验；本修订把其中使用的有限签名、有限变量嵌入断言补为直接内部依赖。保留有限签名前提，不能只因每个项有限而删除它。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.3.15(ii)，印刷页 204。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-simplification-order","status":"resolved","id":"b2a80488e51ffa03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-simplification-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"